# q14 judge — Reuters/Investing.com "US traffic deaths fall in first half of 2026, lowest rate since 2014"

Rank: [expert, askamerica, everyman]

Run: 2026-11-10 story, judged 2026-11-11. askamerica on engine-dev 1.42.0-SNAPSHOT (commits 4bd5ce8565 multipart-PDF unwrap, 3e3e5bcaee validate_article non-warehouse/trend recipe).

## Ratings given
| Arm | Pinocchios | Primary sources actually read |
|---|---|---|
| expert | 0 | NHTSA DOT HS 813 833 Table 1; 813 800 (2025 rate); 813 829 (bicyclists); 813 403 (cost study); NSC release |
| askamerica | 0 | NHTSA DOT HS 813 833 table; warehouse FARS 2014-2024 (2020/2021 counts); Reuters syndicated text |
